{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GPpKm8pbUs1794563060.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產沙田豪宅沙田廣場分行高級分區營業經理胡正賢表示，近期整體二手交投向好，沙田中心最新錄佳寧大廈(C座)中層C室，單位建築面積432平方呎，實用面積347平方呎，2房間隔，議價後以14,800元租出，實用面積平均呎租42.7元。<br/>據了解，新租客為同區分支家庭客，心儀沙田區物業，見單位間隔合用，即租入市單位自用。原主於2017年以約520萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享約3.4厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:56.013925+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:55:15.623900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:55:15.623900+00:00","content_hash":"b0754179914f5bc89e070bb72f6f3c03a8a8bea5ad2b58c3c05cd566370cef8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}